# Oncology Capability Component Mapping Plan

## Problem
All capability cards are showing the same demo content (BRCA Mutation Classifier) instead of content aligned with each specific capability.

## Solution: Create Capability-Specific Demo Wrappers

Each capability needs:
1. ✅ Correct component mapping
2. ✅ Capability-specific seedData
3. ✅ Customized content/messaging

