### Phase 3: Component Wrapper Pattern (DRY)

Create a generic wrapper that:
1. Accepts capability ID
2. Maps to correct component
3. Passes appropriate seedData
4. Customizes intro/outro messaging

```typescript
// CapabilityDemoWrapper.tsx
interface CapabilityDemoWrapperProps {
  capabilityId: string;
  seedData?: any;
}

const CapabilityDemoWrapper: React.FC<CapabilityDemoWrapperProps> = ({ 
  capabilityId, 
  seedData 
}) => {
  const componentMap = {
    'match-patients': SPEFusionPlayground,
    'toxicity-prediction': ToxicityPredictionDemo,
    'resistance-detection': ResistanceDetectionDemo,
    'vus-resolution': VUSResolutionDemo,
    'clinical-trial-matching': ClinicalTrialsMatcher,
  };
  
  const Component = componentMap[capabilityId];
  return <Component {...seedData} />;
};
```

